        "original_id": "4c391b35-45f8-576d-bd82-12e579e1f3dd",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Realex Payments, Paddy Power\n- Products/Services: payment gateway services\n- Places: Dublin, Ireland\n- Topics: transaction processing, bookmaking\n\nFacts:\n- Paddy Power is an Irish bookmaker that was founded in 1988 in Dublin, Ireland.\n- Realex Payments provides a broad range of payment gateway services.\n- Realex Payments processes transactions exceeding €35 billion per year for more than 14,000 clients.\n- Realex Payments' clients include Virgin Atlantic Airways, Vodafone Ireland, the AA, AXA Insurance, Paddy Power, and Aer Lingus.",
